<title>PHILIPPINES: Basketball-Philippine pro league results.</title>
<headline>Basketball-Philippine pro league results.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of elimination round games on Sunday in the Philippine Basketball Association third conference which includes American imports:</p>
<p>Sunkist Orange beat Purefoods Cowboys 103-80 (41-40)</p>
<p>Ginebra San Miguel beat Santa Lucia Realty 81-75 (44-32)</p>
</text>
